uedde T Longerich T Kubicka S Zender L"", ""year"": ""2011"", ""title"": ""Senescence surveillance of pre-malignant hepatocytes limits liver cancer development"", ""doi"": ""10.1038/nature10599"", ""identified_by"": ""citation"", ""study_numbers"": """", ""replication_study_numbers"": """", ""evidence_quote"": ""As part of the Reproducibility Project: Cancer Biology, we published a Registered Report ( Raouf et al., 2015 ) that described how we intended to replicate selected experiments from the paper ‘Senescence surveillance of pre-malignant hepatocytes limits liver cancer development’ ( Kang et al., 2011 )."", ""outcome"": ""uninformative"", ""outcome_quote"": ""To summarize, this replication obtained preliminary outcomes although the experiments were not continued and thus these data are unable to address whether expression of oncogenic Nras G12V in mouse livers induced cellular senescence that were dependent on a functional adaptive immunity, specifically CD4 + T cells."", ""outcome_quote_section"": ""results"", ""outcome_confident"": true, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""Authors explicitly report inability to adjudicate the central finding."", ""outcome_computation"": """", ""outcome_computational_quote"": """", ""outcome_robustness"": """", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": """"}"
